<title>UK: EBRD sets two long-dated zero coupon rand bonds.</title>
<headline>EBRD sets two long-dated zero coupon rand bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Bank for Reconstruction and Development has launched two zero coupon bonds, for two billion rand at 20 years and for five billion rand at 30 years, lead manager Toronto Dominion said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 20-year notes were reoffered at 6.85 percent of face value, the 30-year notes at 2.20 percent.  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    07.APR.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  7.10	PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	REOFFER    6.85	HOME CTRY   SUPRA</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC   0.25</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    5.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    07.APR.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  2.35	PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    2.20	HOME CTRY   SUPRA</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   0.15</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
